```console
$ redkiln run --help
Take the next activity for an item and exit on what it decided

Usage: redkiln run [OPTIONS] <ITEM>

Arguments:
  <ITEM>
          The item to act on

Options:
  -C <PATH>
          Act on the repository at this path instead of the working directory

      --lane <LANE>
          Which lane the item belongs to

          Possible values:
          - fix:   The reactive lane
          - story: The planned lane

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

```
